## Installation Order

The following order is critical for proper boot and functionality:

1. ZygiskNext (required first - base layer)
2. TrickyStore (keybox attestation)
3. PIFork (Play Integrity)
4. DroidSpaces (kernel validation)
5. Permafrost (app freezer/task manager)
6. LSPatch (signature spoofing)
7. EdgeX (gesture injection)

**Note:** Reboot after each module installation except the last one.
DroidSpaces must boot safely before installing subsequent modules (glyph lighting depends on it).